        "sid": "1CH 29"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "29",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma umwami Dawidi abwira ikoraniro ryose ati: “Umuhungu wanje Salomo, ari we Imana yatoranije, aracari muto kandi ntabimenyereye cane. Igikorwa ni kinini, kandi iyi Ngoro si iy’umuntu ahubwo ni iy’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Imana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakoresheje inkomezi zanje zose mu gutegura ivyo kwubaka Ingoro y’Imana yanje: inzahabu zizokora ibikorwa vy’inzahabu, ifeza zizokoreshwa mu gukora ibikorwa vy’ifeza, imyakaka izokoreshwa mu gukora ibikorwa vy’imyakaka, ivyuma bizokoreshwa mu gukora ibikorwa bisaba ivyuma, n’ibiti bizokoreshwa mu gukora ibikorwa bisaba ibiti, n’amabuye azokoreshwa mu gukora ibikorwa bisaba amabuye yitwa onigisi yo gukora mu materanirizo, amabuye akayangana y’amabara atandukanye, n’ubwoko butandukanye bw’amabuye y’igiciro kinini hamwe na marubule; vyose ni vyinshi cane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I ruhande y’ivyo, kubera ukwitangira Ingoro y’Imana yanje, ntanze ubutunzi bwanje bw’inzahabu n’ifeza ngo bibe ivy’iyo Ngoro y’Imana yanje, ndavyongeye kuri vya bindi vyose nateguriye kwubaka Ingoro y’Imana yanje birenze ku vyo nategekanije kubera iyo Ngoro yera: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Italanto ibihumbi bitatu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29:4",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ni nk’amatoni 110.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " z’inzahabu zavuye muri Ofiru, n’iz’ifeza ibihumbi indwi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29:4",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ni nk’amatoni 260.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " zihinguwe neza, zo guhomesha ku mpome y’iyo nyubakwa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ivyo gukoreshwa mu gikorwa c’ifeza n’inzahabu, hamwe n’ibikorwa vyose bikwiye gukorwa n’abahinga. None rero ni nde agomba kwitanga uwu musi kubera ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze abakuru b’imiryango igize Isirayeli, abakuru barongoye ingabo igihumbi n’abarongoye ingabo ijana, n’abakuru bashinzwe gukora i bwami batanga bavyishakiye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Batanga ivyo gukoresha ku Ngoro y’Imana bingana n’italanto ibihumbi bitanu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29:7",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ni nk’amatoni 190.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " na dariki ibihumbi cumi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29:7",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ni nk’ibilo 84.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " vy’inzahabu, italanto ibihumbi cumi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29:7",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ni nk’amatoni 380.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " z’ifeza, italanto ibihumbi cumi n’umunani",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29:7",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ni nk’amatoni 675.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " z’umwakaka n’italanto ibihumbi ijana",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29:7",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ni nk’amatoni 3.800.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " z’ivyuma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umuntu wese yari afise amabuye y’igiciro arayazana ngo aje mu bubiko bw’iyo Ngoro y’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " bwari bujejwe Yehiyeli Umugerishoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu baranezerwa kuko abakuru babo bemeye gukora bavyishakiye, kuko bari bashikaniye ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ata gahato kandi n’umutima ubikunze. N’umwami Dawidi aranezerwa cane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dawidi ahimbaza ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " imbere y’ikoraniro ryose, avuga ati:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko jewe ndi iki, abantu banje bo ni iki, ngo dushobore gutanga tuvyishakiye nk’uku? Vyose biva iwawe, natwe twaguhaye ibiva mu kuboko kwawe gusa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Turi inyambukira n’ingenzi mu nyonga zawe, nk’uko na ba sogokuru bacu bari bari. Imisi yacu kw’isi ni nk’igitutu, nta vyizigiro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yewe ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Mana yacu, ibi vyose twatanze ngo bize vyubake Ingoro izokwitirirwa Izina ryawe Ryera, biva mu kiganza cawe, kandi vyose ni ivyawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndazi, Mana yanje, ko ugera umutima kandi ko uhimbarwa n’ubugororotsi. Ibi vyose nabitanze ata gahato kandi ndavyishakiye. Kandi nezerejwe no kubona uburyo abantu bawe bari aha bagushikaniye ata gahato. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yewe ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", Mana ya ba sogokuru Aburahamu, Isaka na Isirayeli, zigama iki cipfuzo mu mitima y’abantu bawe ibihe bidashira, kandi imitima yabo yame ikuyoboka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi uze uhe umuhungu wanje Salomo kwitanga abikunze ngo aze afate nkama ivyo wamutegetse vyose, n’ivyo wihanikirije n’amabwirizwa yawe, kandi akore vyose ngo yubake iyi Ngoro nk’uko integuro yayo nateguye imeze.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Dawidi abwira ikoraniro ryose ati: “Muhimbaze ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Imana yanyu.” Nuko bose bahimbaza ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", Imana ya ba sekuruza; bunamira ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " n’umwami.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bukeye bashikanira ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ibimazi bamushikanira n’ibimazi vyo gutongozwa umuriro: inka igihumbi, impfizi z’intama igihumbi n’imyagazi y’intama igihumbi, hamwe n’amashikanwa y’ibinyobwa bijanye, n’ibindi bimazi vyinshi vy’Abisirayeli bose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuri uwo musi bararya kandi baranywa banezerewe cane bari imbere y’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze baca bemeza Salomo mwene Dawidi nk’umwami ubwa kabiri, bamwimikisha amavuta imbere y’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ngo abe umutware na Sadoki bamusiga amavuta ngo abe umuherezi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Salomo avyagira ku ntebe y’ubwami bw’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " nk’umwami mu gishingo ca se Dawidi. Agira ikiganza ciza kandi Abisirayeli bose baramwumvira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abakuru bose n’abanyenkomezi, n’abahungu b’umwami Dawidi bose, basezerana kuzokwumvira umwami Salomo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
